-- The museum offices (the book's Area 2 map, 7A-7B), redrawn in our pieces. Turned half round from
-- the book's page, like the Hunting Grounds, so the way in from the jungle side is on the west.
-- The book's arrangement, blown up to fill the mat: a short hall with the stairs up in it, a
-- study either side with its door facing the other across the hall. The archivist's room (north)
-- is locked from the inside; the Celestia study (south) isn't. The south wall is left off.

